        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in a closed mall and you are alone.. or maybe not? With no way out but going down, you must descend using elevator through each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/56dbe5f848ba0fe635aa940b7c073ecb.poster.avif?t=1773902891\" width=720 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/56dbe5f848ba0fe635aa940b7c073ecb.webm?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/56dbe5f848ba0fe635aa940b7c073ecb.mp4?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If anything feel strange, go up using Elevator Behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If nothing strange, go down using Elevator in the Front.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>escape</strong>, or will you become part of the <strong>Anomaly</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/7c23284ac90ef6d4bdc760a66190b46e.poster.avif?t=1773902891\" width=720 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/7c23284ac90ef6d4bdc760a66190b46e.webm?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/7c23284ac90ef6d4bdc760a66190b46e.mp4?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape: Mall</strong> is short walking simulator horror game where you must escape from closed mall while observing surroundings for Anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret to reveal the truth behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/beb99ea5049e63333ecabf1ffb3cdb55.poster.avif?t=1773902891\" width=720 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/beb99ea5049e63333ecabf1ffb3cdb55.webm?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/beb99ea5049e63333ecabf1ffb3cdb55.mp4?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>40 anomaly variations</strong> to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection:</strong> Review anomalies and endings you’ve unlocked in case you missed them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard:</strong> Compete with other players to see who can escape the fastest!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are scary, some require you to remember and spot the differences, some are funny and others are streamer / content creator friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/f6e714bbf92f6026144b633c6bb1d909.poster.avif?t=1773902891\" width=720 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/f6e714bbf92f6026144b633c6bb1d909.webm?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/f6e714bbf92f6026144b633c6bb1d909.mp4?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Language</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game support 10 Languages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/6f828b73210ab2dff28e370b7d72c739.poster.avif?t=1773902891\" width=720 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/6f828b73210ab2dff28e370b7d72c739.webm?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639220/extras/6f828b73210ab2dff28e370b7d72c739.mp4?t=1773902891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Option</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphic settings:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera Shake</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle of camera shake can be turn <strong>on</strong>  for more immersive feel during gameplay or <strong>off</strong> if you feel dizzy by the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse Sensitivity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how responsive movement of your mouse with movement of the camera on the game. If sensitivity is set high, camera movement on the game will move significantly faster when the mouse if moved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Presets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the overall graphic settings to optimized between smooth gameplay performance and visual quality from Low to Epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brightness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust screen brightness to suit your environment and improve visibility in dark areas. This game is set to be dark to enhance the horror experience but you can adjust if it is too dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
